WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:03.836 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:05.704 line:0%
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.704 --> 00:00:08.908
President Biden appeared
last night on "60 Minutes"

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:11.878
and spoke about the ongoing war
between Israel and Hamas.

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:13.646
And you could tell
he was nervous

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:18.484
because he kept asking,
"How many more minutes?"

00:00:18.484 --> 00:00:20.820
The Senate returned this week
from a fall recess.

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:25.925
Unfortunately, the House
is still in detention.

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:27.193
House Republicans on Friday

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:29.028
picked Ohio Congressman
Jim Jordan

00:00:29.028 --> 00:00:30.930
to be their nominee
for Speaker of the House.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:36.669
The vote was 81 "no"
and 124, "Yeah, fine."

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:38.537
Republican Congressman
George Santos

00:00:38.537 --> 00:00:40.940
reportedly got into
a screaming match on Thursday

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:42.809
with an activist
at the Capitol

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:46.012
while holding
a two-month-old baby.

00:00:46.012 --> 00:00:48.314
So finally,
he's actually representing

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:50.283
the people
of Long Island.

00:00:52.818 --> 00:00:55.955
Currently indicted Republican
Congressman George Santos

00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:58.258
was seen leaving
a colleague's office

00:00:58.258 --> 00:01:00.660
carrying a mysterious baby,

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:02.928
and when he was asked
if the baby was his,

00:01:02.928 --> 00:01:06.899
he replied, "Not yet."

00:01:06.899 --> 00:01:11.036
Which brings us to a segment
called, "OK, But For Real,

00:01:11.036 --> 00:01:13.739
Someone's Got Eyes
On This Baby, Right?"

00:01:13.739 --> 00:01:18.211 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:18.211 --> 00:01:21.714
Look, I know there's a lot going
on in the House right now,

00:01:21.714 --> 00:01:23.883
what with the no speaker
and the nomination

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:25.551
of election-denying
insurrectionists.

00:01:25.551 --> 00:01:28.921
But for real, someone's got eyes
on this baby, right?

00:01:28.921 --> 00:01:30.623
Because I don't know
what's happening in this photo,

00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:33.059
I just know it's not good.

00:01:33.059 --> 00:01:35.594
George Santos is currently
under indictment for 23 crimes,

00:01:35.594 --> 00:01:37.463
and by the look of this picture,
he's going for 24.

00:01:37.463 --> 00:01:42.168
I mean, the man's running like
he just intercepted a football.

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:43.703
And then when asked
if the baby was his,

00:01:43.703 --> 00:01:48.307
Santos opted for the most
dramatic possible answer --

00:01:48.307 --> 00:01:50.943
"Not yet."

00:01:50.943 --> 00:01:55.048
Is he a congressman or
a "Days of Our Lives" villain?

00:01:55.048 --> 00:01:57.183
What does "not yet" mean?
Is he going to adopt it,

00:01:57.183 --> 00:02:00.253
or is he going to do away
with the parents?

00:02:00.253 --> 00:02:01.654
Someone please send me a picture

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:03.055
of this baby
holding today's paper,

00:02:03.055 --> 00:02:06.092
because right now
I'm very concerned.

00:02:06.092 --> 00:02:07.860
But at least now we know
George Santos

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:10.029
isn't the craziest person
on Capitol Hill.

00:02:10.029 --> 00:02:14.700
That title goes to whoever
voluntarily handed a baby

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:16.969
to George Santos.

00:02:16.969 --> 00:02:19.005 line:0%
-This has been...

00:02:21.574 --> 00:02:23.842
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:23.842 --> 00:02:27.980
-The CEO of the movie theater
chain AMC posted to X last week

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:29.682
that a blackmailer
had catfished him

00:02:29.682 --> 00:02:31.416
and attempted
to extort him for money.

00:02:31.416 --> 00:02:32.718
"I know the feeling,"

00:02:32.718 --> 00:02:36.589
said someone who just paid $40
for popcorn and a drink.

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:42.829
A woman in Australia
is recovering

00:02:42.829 --> 00:02:45.932
after she tried to rescue
a platypus with her bare hands,

00:02:45.932 --> 00:02:49.001
and was stabbed
with its poisonous spurs.

00:02:49.001 --> 00:02:50.336
Though in her defense,

00:02:50.336 --> 00:02:54.807
even the platypus
didn't know it could do that.

00:02:54.807 --> 00:03:00.312
"Damn, I truly am weird as hell.

00:03:00.312 --> 00:03:05.818
"Every day, I learn
a new crazy fact about me.

00:03:05.818 --> 00:03:08.288
Oh, I just laid an egg."

00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:15.794
And finally, Netflix recently
unveiled plans to open two

00:03:15.794 --> 00:03:18.865
so-called Netflix House venues
where customers can eat, drink,

00:03:18.865 --> 00:03:20.500
and buy merchandise,
or more likely,

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:22.702
just look at the menu
for two hours and leave.

00:03:22.702 --> 00:03:24.337 line:0%
♪♪

00:03:24.337 --> 00:03:27.240
During the first ballot in
today's House speakership vote,

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:28.774
Ohio congressman Jim Jordan

00:03:28.774 --> 00:03:33.012
fell short of the 217 votes
necessary to become speaker.

00:03:33.012 --> 00:03:35.448
But Republicans are determined
to keep trying

00:03:35.448 --> 00:03:37.550
until they finally get it wrong.

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:39.185
[ Laughter ]

00:03:39.185 --> 00:03:41.486
During the first ballot in
today's House speakership vote,

00:03:41.486 --> 00:03:42.955
several Republicans voted

00:03:42.955 --> 00:03:45.725
for former New York
congressman Lee Zeldin,

00:03:45.725 --> 00:03:47.626
which means they are
running out of options,

00:03:47.626 --> 00:03:50.496
even alphabetically.

00:03:50.496 --> 00:03:52.332
"What about Ziggy Zyzax?

00:03:52.332 --> 00:03:56.069
He's -- He's strong
on the border, right?"

00:03:56.069 --> 00:03:57.736
Florida governor Ron DeSantis
over the weekend

00:03:57.736 --> 00:03:59.638
announced that about
200 Floridians

00:03:59.638 --> 00:04:03.076
were evacuated from Israel
and landed in Tampa,

00:04:03.076 --> 00:04:05.278
marking the first time
in recorded history

00:04:05.278 --> 00:04:07.980
that anyone was happy
to land in Tampa.

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:09.248
[ Laughter ]

00:04:09.248 --> 00:04:11.384
"Well, maybe we'll
meet Tom Brady.

00:04:11.384 --> 00:04:15.655
"What? Retired?"

00:04:15.655 --> 00:04:17.356
In a post today on Truth Social,

00:04:17.356 --> 00:04:20.759
former president Trump said
that Ohio congressman Jim Jordan

00:04:20.759 --> 00:04:22.895
will be a great House speaker
and added that he had

00:04:22.895 --> 00:04:25.264
his "complete and total
endorsement."

00:04:25.264 --> 00:04:27.767
"Good luck with that,"
said David Perdue, Kari Lake,

00:04:27.767 --> 00:04:30.436
Doug Mastriano,
Herschel Walker, Dr. Oz,

00:04:30.436 --> 00:04:33.171
and that kid he forced
to mow his lawn.

00:04:33.171 --> 00:04:35.641
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:04:35.641 --> 00:04:37.109
It's a long list.

00:04:37.109 --> 00:04:41.180
Justice Amy Coney Barrett
said in an interview yesterday

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:44.016
that the Supreme Court
should adopt an ethics code

00:04:44.016 --> 00:04:47.386
and added, "All nine justices
are very committed

00:04:47.386 --> 00:04:50.122
to the highest standards
of ethical conduct."

00:04:50.122 --> 00:04:53.192
And when he read that interview,
Clarence Thomas laughed so hard,

00:04:53.192 --> 00:04:55.995
he almost fell off
a billionaire's yacht.

00:04:55.995 --> 00:04:57.863
[ Laughter ]

00:04:57.863 --> 00:05:01.033
The drug manufacturer
Novo Nordisk announced yesterday

00:05:01.033 --> 00:05:03.936
that it has acquired
a new hypertension drug

00:05:03.936 --> 00:05:06.172
for $1.3 billion,

00:05:06.172 --> 00:05:08.207
but they quickly
made that money back

00:05:08.207 --> 00:05:10.743
after selling
five vials of insulin.

00:05:10.743 --> 00:05:14.647
[ Audience groans ]

00:05:14.647 --> 00:05:18.117
I guess my question is, where
did we think the laugh was?

00:05:18.117 --> 00:05:20.285
[ Laughter ]

00:05:20.285 --> 00:05:21.554
Like, as I'm saying it,
I'm like,

00:05:21.554 --> 00:05:23.456
"Wait, this might not work."

00:05:23.456 --> 00:05:25.325
[ Laughter ]

00:05:29.228 --> 00:05:30.863
Alright, well...

00:05:30.863 --> 00:05:32.699
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:35.868
Got something pretty cool,
though,

00:05:35.868 --> 00:05:37.069
'cause you had to
suffer through that.

00:05:37.069 --> 00:05:39.238
Everybody look under your seat.
Vial of insulin.

00:05:39.238 --> 00:05:40.940
[ Laughter ]

00:05:43.242 --> 00:05:44.643
According to a new survey,

00:05:44.643 --> 00:05:47.679
baby boomers said
their top source for new slang

00:05:47.679 --> 00:05:49.115
is younger family members.

00:05:49.115 --> 00:05:51.117
Said your grandma,
"I crashed my whip

00:05:51.117 --> 00:05:52.885
into the post office again."

00:05:52.885 --> 00:05:55.855
[ Laughter ]

00:05:55.855 --> 00:05:57.289
According to the same survey,

00:05:57.289 --> 00:06:00.526
the most popular new slang word
used in Florida is "sus."

00:06:00.526 --> 00:06:04.263
Well, yeah.
Have you ever been there?

00:06:04.263 --> 00:06:09.101
I'm surprised it's not also
the most popular baby name.

00:06:09.101 --> 00:06:11.437
"Yeah, we're calling him Sus.
We don't --

00:06:11.437 --> 00:06:13.406
Doesn't look like either of us."

00:06:13.406 --> 00:06:16.041
[ Laughter ]

00:06:16.041 --> 00:06:19.111
Walmart has announced it will
offer the limited-edition

00:06:19.111 --> 00:06:21.714
Van Leeuwen Kraft
Macaroni &amp; Cheese ice cream.

00:06:21.714 --> 00:06:25.084
It's a great way to make sure
your death is ruled a suicide.

00:06:25.084 --> 00:06:27.686
[ Laughter ]

00:06:27.686 --> 00:06:29.889
And finally --

00:06:29.889 --> 00:06:32.290
You know would be good
with that?

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:35.293
Little vial of something.

00:06:35.293 --> 00:06:37.129
Not going to say what.

00:06:37.129 --> 00:06:40.333
And finally, Coca-Cola
and the makers of Absolut Vodka

00:06:40.333 --> 00:06:42.301
announced yesterday
they're planning to release

00:06:42.301 --> 00:06:45.304
a new ready-to-drink
vodka-Sprite cocktail,

00:06:45.304 --> 00:06:47.773
because if you're mixing
vodka and Sprite,

00:06:47.773 --> 00:06:50.743
you're ready to drink.

00:06:50.743 --> 00:06:53.846
Yeah, I don't know, just two
liquids, one of them alcohol.

00:06:53.846 --> 00:06:55.615 line:0%
♪♪

00:06:55.615 --> 00:06:58.116
Ohio Congressman Jim Jordan

00:06:58.116 --> 00:06:59.785
failed to secure
enough votes today

00:06:59.785 --> 00:07:02.188
in the second round of voting
to become House Speaker,

00:07:02.188 --> 00:07:04.857
and received only 199 votes.

00:07:04.857 --> 00:07:07.025
That's worse
than he did yesterday.

00:07:07.025 --> 00:07:08.293
If they keep doing votes,

00:07:08.293 --> 00:07:10.296
he's eventually
gonna get to zero,

00:07:10.296 --> 00:07:13.766
and then he'll fade away like
Marty McFly in a family photo.

00:07:13.766 --> 00:07:14.934
[ Laughter ]

00:07:14.934 --> 00:07:16.269
The White House announced
last night

00:07:16.269 --> 00:07:18.304
that President Biden's
scheduled stop in Jordan

00:07:18.304 --> 00:07:19.705
has been canceled,

00:07:19.705 --> 00:07:23.042
making it the second Jordan
to get shut down this week.

00:07:23.042 --> 00:07:24.844
[ Laughter ]

00:07:24.844 --> 00:07:26.712
President Biden arrived
this morning in Israel,

00:07:26.712 --> 00:07:28.914
making him the first president
to visit Israel

00:07:28.914 --> 00:07:31.484
during a time of war,
which is pretty dangerous.

00:07:31.484 --> 00:07:34.820
But he should be okay once
he makes it down the stairs.

00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:36.856
[ Laughter ]

00:07:38.991 --> 00:07:41.661
The Treasury Department
announced new sanctions today

00:07:41.661 --> 00:07:44.163
against 10 entities
that are linked to Hamas,

00:07:44.163 --> 00:07:48.167
including the cryptocurrency
firm Buy Cash.

00:07:48.167 --> 00:07:51.637
Oh, uh, was a cryptocurrency
firm up to no good?

00:07:51.637 --> 00:07:53.238
[ Laughter ]

00:07:53.238 --> 00:07:55.073
And it's called Buy Cash?

00:07:55.073 --> 00:07:58.010
"Hey, what's a good
non-suspicious name

00:07:58.010 --> 00:07:59.344
"for a crypto firm?

00:07:59.344 --> 00:08:01.280
How about Buy Cash?"

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:02.281
[ Laughter ]

00:08:02.281 --> 00:08:04.116
If I drove past a strip mall

00:08:04.116 --> 00:08:07.453
and there was a store
called Buy Cash,

00:08:07.453 --> 00:08:10.456
I would lock my doors
and call the police.

00:08:10.456 --> 00:08:11.624
[ Laughter ]

00:08:11.624 --> 00:08:14.092
Florida Congresswoman
Anna Paulina Luna

00:08:14.092 --> 00:08:16.161
reportedly brought
her newborn baby

00:08:16.161 --> 00:08:17.864
to yesterday's
House Speaker vote.

00:08:17.864 --> 00:08:19.898
Well, congratulations
to the new mom

00:08:19.898 --> 00:08:22.101
and the new Speaker!

00:08:22.101 --> 00:08:23.936
[ Laughter ]

00:08:23.936 --> 00:08:26.605
Baby with a gavel!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:26.605 --> 00:08:28.341
Baby with a gavel.

00:08:30.042 --> 00:08:32.711
That's one of comedy's
first rules.

00:08:32.711 --> 00:08:35.714
Can't go wrong with a baby
with a gavel.

00:08:35.714 --> 00:08:38.050
Former President Trump yesterday
attacked the judge

00:08:38.050 --> 00:08:39.952
overseeing
his civil fraud trial,

00:08:39.952 --> 00:08:41.720
in a post on Truth Social,

00:08:41.720 --> 00:08:44.990
and said he's serving "as judge,
jury, and everything else."

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:47.660
I'm guessing this was after
three failed attempts

00:08:47.660 --> 00:08:49.829
to spell "executioner."

00:08:49.829 --> 00:08:51.898
[ Laughter ]

00:08:53.899 --> 00:08:57.303
[As Trump] Judge, jury,
and big guy with ax and mask.

00:08:57.303 --> 00:08:59.972
[ Laughter ]

00:08:59.972 --> 00:09:01.307
-[Normal voice] That's right.

00:09:01.307 --> 00:09:03.542
Trump attacked the judge
overseeing his civil fraud trial

00:09:03.542 --> 00:09:06.111
despite being under
a partial gag order.

00:09:06.111 --> 00:09:07.446
Yeah, I don't think you can...

00:09:07.446 --> 00:09:08.781
Yeah, don't...
[ Gibberish ]

00:09:08.781 --> 00:09:10.516
[Bleep]

00:09:10.516 --> 00:09:12.718
I know, I stumbled
on the wording earlier,

00:09:12.718 --> 00:09:14.953
and I didn't rewrite it,
and it's my fault.

00:09:14.953 --> 00:09:17.222
Okay, here we go.
Alright. Yeah.

00:09:17.222 --> 00:09:19.658
Let's go back and take it again.
It's definitely...

00:09:19.658 --> 00:09:21.293
This isn't gonna
throw it at all.

00:09:21.293 --> 00:09:22.795
[ Laughter ]

00:09:22.795 --> 00:09:25.798
I don't -- I don't even think
they've noticed I flubbed up.

00:09:25.798 --> 00:09:28.134
[ Laughter ]

00:09:28.134 --> 00:09:30.669
I've played it so smoothly.

00:09:30.669 --> 00:09:32.838
[ Laughter ]

00:09:32.838 --> 00:09:34.674
That's right.
Trump attacked the judge

00:09:34.674 --> 00:09:36.174
overseeing his civil fraud trial

00:09:36.174 --> 00:09:37.876
despite being under
a partial gag order.

00:09:37.876 --> 00:09:40.078
Yeah, you don't think
you can shut Trump up

00:09:40.078 --> 00:09:42.448
with a partial gag order,
do you?

00:09:42.448 --> 00:09:44.717
You can't even shut him up
with a full gag order.

00:09:44.717 --> 00:09:47.886
You could put them in the full
Hannibal Lecter outfit,

00:09:47.886 --> 00:09:50.556
and he would still find a way
to get the word out.

00:09:50.556 --> 00:09:52.725
[ Laughter ]

00:09:52.725 --> 00:09:55.895
In an effort to reduce pollution
caused by microplastics,

00:09:55.895 --> 00:10:00.066
a European Union ban on the sale
of loose plastic glitter

00:10:00.066 --> 00:10:01.701
went into effect this week.

00:10:01.701 --> 00:10:03.535
Some great news that, sadly,

00:10:03.535 --> 00:10:05.538
there was no way to celebrate.

00:10:05.538 --> 00:10:07.673
[ Laughter ]

00:10:11.510 --> 00:10:13.846
United Airlines
has reportedly decided

00:10:13.846 --> 00:10:16.014
to implement
a new boarding strategy

00:10:16.014 --> 00:10:20.018
that allows economy passengers
in window seats to board first.

00:10:20.018 --> 00:10:21.553
Meanwhile, Spirit Airlines

00:10:21.553 --> 00:10:23.488
has decided
to streamline boarding

00:10:23.488 --> 00:10:25.324
with a starting gun.

00:10:25.324 --> 00:10:27.326
[ Laughter ]

00:10:29.428 --> 00:10:33.198
The US Mint yesterday announced
that journalist Ida B. Wells

00:10:33.198 --> 00:10:35.200
will be honored
with her face on a quarter.

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:36.735
Because what greater honor

00:10:36.735 --> 00:10:38.570
than being bounced
into a Solo cup

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:40.372
by a drunk freshman?

00:10:40.372 --> 00:10:42.040
[ Laughter ]

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:43.809
And finally, Netflix recently
unveiled plans

00:10:43.809 --> 00:10:45.344
for its first
live sports event,

00:10:45.344 --> 00:10:47.813
which will feature
Formula One drivers and golfers

00:10:47.813 --> 00:10:50.148
teaming up to compete
in a golf tournament.

00:10:50.148 --> 00:10:52.918
So, if you love the intense,
high-speed excitement

00:10:52.918 --> 00:10:55.921
of Formula One racing,
get ready to strap yourself in

00:10:55.921 --> 00:10:57.423
for some golf.

00:10:57.423 --> 00:10:59.058
[ Laughter ]

00:10:59.058 --> 00:11:01.026
President Biden spoke
from the Oval Office

00:11:01.026 --> 00:11:02.928
tonight in a primetime address

00:11:02.928 --> 00:11:06.832
and asked Congress to approve
$100 billion in emergency funds.

00:11:06.832 --> 00:11:08.400
Well, good luck with that.

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:13.405
We can't even get Congress
to approve each other.

00:11:13.405 --> 00:11:16.809
Republican Congressman
Carlos Giménez said yesterday

00:11:16.809 --> 00:11:19.244
that his office
has received robocalls

00:11:19.244 --> 00:11:21.881
encouraging to vote for Ohio
congressman Jim Jordan.

00:11:21.881 --> 00:11:24.316
But then he remembered
he actually saved

00:11:24.316 --> 00:11:29.354
Jordan's number
as "Scam Likely."

00:11:29.354 --> 00:11:31.456
A group of moderate
Republican lawmakers

00:11:31.456 --> 00:11:34.126
are reportedly pushing
to temporarily empower

00:11:34.126 --> 00:11:36.861
acting House Speaker Pro Tem
Patrick McHenry.

00:11:36.861 --> 00:11:39.297
Oh, you mean this guy?

00:11:39.297 --> 00:11:44.536
The --
The congressman from Asgard?

00:11:44.536 --> 00:11:46.405
Are we sure the lectern
can handle it?

00:11:46.405 --> 00:11:50.009
He slammed that thing like
they just canceled "Frasier."

00:11:53.946 --> 00:11:57.782
Come on.
That dude watches "Frasier."

00:11:57.782 --> 00:12:00.485
While leaving court yesterday,
former President Trump

00:12:00.485 --> 00:12:02.921
said that he "probably
won't return this week"

00:12:02.921 --> 00:12:04.823
because of an upcoming
golf tournament

00:12:04.823 --> 00:12:07.760
at his Miami golf club
and he doesn't want to miss it

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:09.261
because it's probably
the last time

00:12:09.261 --> 00:12:13.832
it will be considered
his Miami golf club.

00:12:13.832 --> 00:12:16.001
A man in Kenya was arrested
recently for allegedly

00:12:16.001 --> 00:12:19.638
impersonating a lawyer
and winning dozens of lawsuits.

00:12:19.638 --> 00:12:21.673
"I have the exact opposite
problem,"

00:12:21.673 --> 00:12:23.476
said Rudy Giuliani.

00:12:26.211 --> 00:12:30.282
"Maybe I should stop
pretending!"

00:12:30.282 --> 00:12:33.686
In his upcoming biography,
Utah Senator Mitt Romney

00:12:33.686 --> 00:12:36.922
criticizes former Texas governor
Rick Perry and says,

00:12:36.922 --> 00:12:40.325
"Republicans must realize
that we have to have someone

00:12:40.325 --> 00:12:42.227
who can complete a sentence."

00:12:42.227 --> 00:12:45.197
Responded Perry, "How dare --"

00:12:50.602 --> 00:12:53.038
The drugstore chain
Rite Aid announced yesterday

00:12:53.038 --> 00:12:55.340
that it will close
at least 150 stores.

00:12:55.340 --> 00:12:58.176
So, the Rite Aid
I was in last week.

00:12:58.176 --> 00:13:01.247
You're telling me
that was open?

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:08.020
I should have paid somebody.

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:09.922
And finally, a couple recently
got married

00:13:09.922 --> 00:13:12.724
during the 10-second pit stop
of a NASCAR race.

00:13:12.724 --> 00:13:15.961
And this is embarrassing.
The honeymoon was even faster.

00:13:15.961 --> 00:13:19.464
"I swear this never happens."

00:13:19.464 --> 00:13:21.300
That was the monologue,
everybody!

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:26.238 line:0%
♪♪

